{
  "slug": "notes-to-video",
  "name": "Notes To Video",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Turn lecture notes (PDF, LaTeX, markdown) into animated 3Blue1Brown-style explainer videos. Handles the full pipeline: content extraction, narration writing with cue-based audio-video sync, Manim scene generation, validation, rendering, and composition. Four TTS backends including free Edge-TTS. Cross-platform (Linux/macOS/Windows), no GPU required by default.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `notes-to-video` (Turn notes (LaTeX, PDF, or plain text) into 3Blue1Brown-style animated videos using Manim + TTS + ffmpeg).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install notes-to-video@claude-community` from `cymcymcymcym/notes-to-video`.\n\nTurn notes (LaTeX, PDF, or plain text) into animated explainer videos in the style popularized by 3Blue1Brown — using Manim, TTS, and ffmpeg.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
